			"date": "2023-09-21T14:36:55.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> It’s kind of like a community of butchers saying “It's so fun to make the sausage, we don’t care if it is edible, someone will fix that”</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "111103650724349398",
