			},
			"date": "2023-09-21T14:39:30.475Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@marcus\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>marcus</span></a></span> it’s a very Silicon Valley mentality, I think—unsurprisingly popularized by Facebook!</p><p>Move fast and break things, indeed.</p>",
