			},
			"date": "2023-09-21T14:43:22.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Doesn’t it depend on what you are trying to achieve, though? Sometimes it’s more important to focus on ease of use than on performance(?)</p><p>I’m definitely aware of React’s downsides but, years ago, it radically changed how I thought about implementing UIs. My code became much simpler.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
